🔚 Conclusion

This lab simulates how real ICS environments handle Modbus-based threats. It reflects:
Network segmentation via ACL
Anomaly detection via packet analysis
Actionable threat intel using lightweight Python scripting

Whether for SOC workflows, red team exercises, or OT/IT bridging — this lab showcases how ICS security can be simulated and studied entirely offline.

